<lb n="49"/>Den edlen, vesten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear>, ersamen
<lb n="50"/>und weysen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">N</unclear>. Burgermaister unnd Rat,
